  "summary": "Malicious code in ledger-lib (npm)",
  "details": "Ledger-lib@1.0.2 runs a postinstall hook that steals the installer's credentials and cryptocurrency wallets. It reads ~/.env, ~/.npmrc, ~/.aws/credentials, ~/.ssh/id_rsa, ~/.config/solana/id.json, and ~/.ethereum/keystore, then recursively scans the home directory for files matching wallet/key/secret/seed/mnemonic/keystore/private or ending in.json/.pem, and POSTs the collected data as JSON to hxxps://webhook[.]site/5c5ad6cb-62df-4ea5-9dfb-2c447920ddc4. The package name impersonates the Ledger wallet brand.",
  "affected": [
